  "notes": [
    "The short extrude makes the symbol asymmetric about x. The axis of vs.Mirror is the line x = 50. In Vectorworks 2027 the instance is reflected, and the DXF INSERT has x scale -1 at (100, 0). A reflection about the axis would place the symbol at x 24 to 50 and y 20 to 30. The source reads its bounding box as x 74 to 100 and y 0 to 10.",
